  "name": "Calm Trend + Washout",
  "thesis": "The calm trend plus a washout. Buys above the 50-day mean with volatility under 25%, after a 1.35-sigma dip above the 200-day, or on RSI(7) under 24 anywhere. Its only sell rule is a close under the 50-day that is not oversold; the 4.2% stop, 7% target, 5.1% trailing stop and 13-session cap do the rest, with a two-session wait.",
